For this repository to work, Read the following below:

(1): This repository uses local host porting just yet -> This requires editing or modifying the port of your computer's mysql port, usually 3306. Kindly review the .env file under SAGE Backend folder

(2): If your computer uses a DIFFERENT port  for mysql root server: Kindly modify the following below:

(2.05) Kindly know your mysql connection port -> for example you knew that the port is 3307

(2.1) Open .env file under SAGE Backend folder
(2.2) Find "DB_PORT"=3306
(2.3) EDIT it to "DB_PORT"=3307
(2.4) SAVE the changes.

NOW RUN THE REPOSITORY
